./iterations/iter_009/solver_attempt.md:111:Use the explicit \(\delta_*(C)\) formula to attack the known-path anytime characterization. It gives both the optimal local randomized quote law and the exact local obstruction.
./iterations/iter_009/solver_attempt.md:115:Use rare-event versions of the finite-\(C\) block to stress-test essential-sup tail conditions: probability-weighted \(\delta_*(C)\), not raw delay length, is the relevant expected-regret obstruction.
